          "type": "data",
          "data": {
            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h1 id=\"cloudflare-data-operations-r2-ducklake-iceberg\">Cloudflare Data Operations: R2 + DuckLake + Iceberg</h1>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">This notebook demonstrates Cloudflare's data infrastructure:</span>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>R2 Storage</strong> - S3-compatible object storage with AWS SigV4 signing</li>\n<li><strong>D1 Database</strong> - SQLite at the edge for structured data</li>\n<li><strong>DuckLake</strong> - Lightweight lakehouse format on R2</li>\n<li><strong>PyIceberg</strong> - Table format for analytics with time travel</li>\n</ol>\n<blockquote>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">Based on patterns from <code>/data/examples/cloudflare/</code> and <code>/data/examples/duckdb/cloudflare-ducklake/</code></span>\n</blockquote></span>"
          }
        }
      ],
      "console": []
    },
