            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h2 id=\"4-pyiceberg-with-r2-catalog\">4. PyIceberg with R2 Catalog</h2>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">Iceberg tables provide ACID transactions, time travel, and schema evolution on R2.</span></span>"
